       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. difference-of-squares.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-DIFFERENCE-OF-SQUARES PIC 9(8).
       01 WS-SUM-OF-SQUARES PIC 9(8).
       01 WS-SQUARE-OF-SUM PIC 9(8).
       01 WS-NUMBER PIC 9(8).
       01 WS-SQUARE-MINUS-SUM PIC S9(8).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       
       SQUARE-OF-SUM.
           COMPUTE WS-SQUARE-OF-SUM = (WS-NUMBER * (WS-NUMBER + 1) / 2) ** 2
           .

       SUM-OF-SQUARES.
           COMPUTE WS-SUM-OF-SQUARES = WS-NUMBER * (WS-NUMBER + 1) * (2 * WS-NUMBER + 1) / 6
           .

       DIFFERENCE-OF-SQUARES.
           PERFORM SQUARE-OF-SUM
           PERFORM SUM-OF-SQUARES
           COMPUTE WS-SQUARE-MINUS-SUM = WS-SQUARE-OF-SUM - WS-SUM-OF-SQUARES
           IF WS-SQUARE-MINUS-SUM < 0 THEN
               COMPUTE WS-DIFFERENCE-OF-SQUARES = -WS-SQUARE-MINUS-SUM
           ELSE
               COMPUTE WS-DIFFERENCE-OF-SQUARES = WS-SQUARE-MINUS-SUM
           END-IF
           .
